      "sequence_position": 12,
      "problem": "Given that $r(t)=⟨cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi t}{2}),\\,\\frac{4}{t-1}⟩,$ what is $|r(3)|?$\n\n$|r(3)|=$\n{{field-1}}",
